NA: But the stage remains empty.

NA: Dust dances in the light streaming through the gaps in the roof.

NA: And in the middle of that abandoned theater...

NA: Lies an old cape, split down the middle.

NA: Half light, half dark.

NA: Silent and still.

NA: Waiting for someone who will never return.

